{"articleNo":"2944","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2944&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-2학기 학부 학생 일반대학원 교과목 사전이수 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.08.31","hit":"9547","attachments":[{"name":"학부학생 일반대학원 교과목 이수 신청서(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2944&attachNo=1889"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"461\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"66\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">학부 학생 일반대학원 교과목 사전이수 신청 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;학부 학생의 대학원 교과목 사전이수 신청 기간을 아래와 같이 공지하오니 해당기간 내에 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp; -</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 이수 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 09. 07(수) ~ 09. 09(금)[3일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 대상학생 : 학부의 4학년 이상 재학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 대학원 교과목 수강학점 : 학기당 3학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">) 학부과목과 대학원 과목을 합하여 학생의 학기당 수강신청 최대 학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 단, 초과학기자는 학기당 6학점 신청 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 제출장소 : 각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 제출서류 : 학부학생 일반대학원 교과목 이수 신청서 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 08.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
